    "goal": "Build exactly one workflow that reads both printed text AND barcodes from the whole image, using apple-vision for both readers. Show both kinds of recognized values and their regions. Do not crop or resize. Do not record events or send alerts. Use text_accuracy with target 0.9.",
    "assumptions": [
      "Use the project's imported media and saved region geometry.",
      "A sample preview does not establish accuracy.",
      "Evaluation requires reviewed labels on the same held-out data for every candidate."
    ],
